# UX workflow: compact sequencer rejection feedback.
# Purpose: keeps an unavailable edit explicit without presenting a punitive or
# redundant three-line error, then proves that the transient card expires.
# Expect: capture_changed:history_unavailable_no_change=history_feedback_expired

0 scenario seq-history-unavailable-feedback
80 capture screen history_unavailable_no_change

1600 tick
1680 capture screen history_feedback_expired

# Keep the workflow subject to the normal binding-dispatch gate.
1760 tap BOTTOM_CENTER 60
